<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#0A0A0A;">Sollecito inviato</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;">È partito il {{reminderLabel}} sollecito a {{partyName}}{{#if productName}} per {{productName}}, contratto <strong style="font-weight:600;">{{contractCode}}</strong>{{/if}}: fattura del {{issuedAt}}, di <strong style="font-weight:600;">{{amount}}</strong>.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:28px 0 0 0;">
<tr>
<td class="rk-btn" ${button_cell}>
<a href="{{scheduleUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">Apri lo scadenziario</a>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
